          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Veskit, High executioner of clan eshin" id="80bc-c441-bbb8-34f4" hidden="false">
          <description>Mav be Hired: Veskit mav only be hired bv Skaven warbands.

80 gold crowns to hire: + 35 gold crowns upkeep cost.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Unfeeling" id="7f03-3f34-b9b1-9b1b" hidden="false">
          <description>Veskit is a cold, calculating killing machine, and feels few of the emotions that living things do.
He is therefore immune to all psychology.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="No Pain" id="ff40-9ef3-6f19-9051" hidden="false">
          <description>Veskit ignores knocked down and stunned results on the Injury chart.

He must lose his last wound and be taken out of action before he is removed from battle.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Unblinking Eye" id="cd23-e2ad-cca6-9230" hidden="false">
          <description>Thanks to the sorcerous devices built by the Warlock Engineers of Clan Skrvre.

Veskit can spot hidden enemies within twice his Initiative value in inches.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Metallic Body" id="2195-8ae5-d084-093d" hidden="false">
          <description>These give Veskit his high Toughness and a 3 + armour save.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
